SH-C31A firmware v1.5 -- patch against
https://github.com/tymmothy/candleLight_fw_canable_v2_fd  at commit 49d96c6

The upstream project is MIT-licensed; this patch is released under the same
licence. Apply with `git apply` on a clean checkout of that commit and build
as described in BUILD.md. Everything v1.5 adds sits behind
CONFIG_BOOT0_DEFAULT_OFF_SH_C31A: without it the same patch builds v1.4.

